OL,3,ADemocrats win largest House majority   
OL,4,Asince 1992 after flipping North        
OL,5,ACarolina seat                          
OL,7,FThe Democratic Party has won the       
OL,8,Flargest majority in the US House of    
OL,9,FRepresentatives since 1992, after      
OL,10,FDemocrat Chuck Hubbard unseated        
OL,11,FRepublican Representative Virginia Foxx
OL,12,Fin North Carolina.                     
OL,14,FThe race was called on Sunday, with    
OL,15,FHubbard beating Foxx by 330 votes with 
OL,16,F99% counted. It was one of the closest 
OL,17,Fcontests of the recent midterm         
OL,18,Felections, in which Democrats also     
OL,19,Fsecured the Senate.                    
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
