OL,3,ADemocrats win largest House majority   
OL,4,Asince 1992 after flipping North        
OL,5,ACarolina seat                          
OL,7,FThe party has now won at least 258     
OL,8,FHouse seats in the midterms compared to
OL,9,FRepublicans, who hold at least 173     
OL,10,Fseats, with four races still yet to be 
OL,11,Fcalled.                                
OL,13,FNeither party had won as many House    
OL,14,Fraces since 1992, when Bill Clinton won
OL,15,Fthe presidency and Democrats won a     
OL,16,Ftotal of 258 seats.                    
